{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "The skin registry (docs/50-sprites-skins.md \u00a72). Changing how a character",
    "looks is an edit here, not a code change.",
    "",
    "Resolution is atlas + prefix + frame name, which is why five characters cost",
    "five entries and no new art: Kenney's pack ships one rig in five variants and",
    "scripts/build-atlas.mjs names them `character_<variant>_<pose>`.",
    "",
    "The server knows only `skin_id` (\u00a71). It never validates it against this file",
    "and never sends a texture name, so adding a skin is a client-side change.",
    "",
    "anchor.y 0.86: the art is 110 px tall for a 28 px hitbox, and this is where",
    "that gets reconciled \u2014 the sprite's feet sit at the bottom of the AABB. It is",
    "per-skin because different art has different proportions."
  ],
