  "_tombstones_comment": [
    "Tombstone skins (docs/71-amendments-v3.md \u00a7B8). `atlas: null` means drawn",
    "procedurally at runtime, the same convention the weapons use: no Kenney pack",
    "ships a grave marker, and docs/51 \u00a75's procedural fallback is the shipping",
    "path for anything the packs do not cover. Choosing a terrain tile that vaguely",
    "reads as a headstone is the mistake \u00a7A32 caught \u2014 two decor frames turned out",
    "to be 98% opaque terrain tiles \u2014 and verify-assets now rejects it.",
    "",
    "Ids are wire values (`tombstone_skin_id`), so this order is not cosmetic.",
    "The art is in client/src/render/tombstoneTextures.ts; these five differ in",
    "SILHOUETTE rather than palette, because at 14x18 px the outline is all a",
    "player can read and a picker whose options differ only by colour has one",
    "option."
  ]
